OL,3,CGovernment urged to act to make
OL,4,Cteaching profession more attractive
OL,6,FGovernment has been urged to act to
OL,7,Fmake the teaching profession more
OL,8,Fattractive.
OL,10,FThe Teachers' Union of Ireland (TUI)
OL,11,Fsaid the retention of teachers within
OL,12,Fthe system is now "as big a challenge
OL,13,Fas initial recruitment".
OL,15,FThey also said teachers are being
OL,16,Fdeflected from teaching by ever-
OL,17,Fincreasing administrative duties.
OL,26,@tD@SOUuD@WO]
