OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1787015895
OL,3,CGovernment urged to act to make
OL,4,Cteaching profession more attractive
OL,6,F"Allowances payable for SEN
OL,7,Fqualification, teaching through Irish
OL,8,Fand teaching on an island were all
OL,9,Fabolished in 2012 and have made
OL,10,Frecruitment and retention in these
OL,11,Fschools more difficult," he said.
OL,13,F"It is critically important for these
OL,14,Fschools that these be reinstated."
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@XO]uD@AOUvD@bO]
